notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T13:45:53.751Z",pi-agent,Bumped peerDependencies @unbrained/pm-cli from >=2026.7.26 to >=2026.7.27 and devDependencies from ^2026.7.26 to ^2026.7.27. Package version was already 2026.7.27 from the release bot commit. Ran npm install; confirmed installed CLI version is 2026.7.27.
  "2026-07-27T13:45:54.100Z",pi-agent,"Flag-collision grep: grep -nE on index.ts src/*.ts found 3 hits (index.ts:1423 comment, index.ts:2077 programmatic pm invocation passing --json to pm list-all, index.ts:2296 comment). No host-owned global flags declared in the single flags: array. Extension flags are --weeks, --group-by, --status, --from, --to, --schedule, --default-duration, --critical-path, --critical-only, --progress, --show-progress, --width, --milestones. Audit clean."
  "2026-07-27T13:45:54.545Z",pi-agent,"Gates: build OK, typecheck OK, check OK, 78/78 tests pass. changelog:full OK, changelog:check OK. Activation proof: pm gantt --help exit 0, extension active. Exercised pm gantt (exit 0) and pm gantt --weeks 2 --group-by type (exit 0). Also rebuilt dist/ to 2026.7.27 (release bot had not rebuilt it)."
